    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST NOW!</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838480/extras/cf45759ef3c5726bd6fa3c5ba5038ff8.avif?t=1744470936\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838480/extras/51f261a8544f03d6d903cc93d3e2ba87.poster.avif?t=1744470936\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838480/extras/51f261a8544f03d6d903cc93d3e2ba87.webm?t=1744470936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838480/extras/51f261a8544f03d6d903cc93d3e2ba87.mp4?t=1744470936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838480/extras/2c8a7823abab6f4848038e03cceb1a36.avif?t=1744470936\" /></div> <br>Embark on an exciting Point &amp; Click adventure with <strong> Travel to GolemPark </strong>, a game that follows the journey of a boy named Mick who wins tickets to a robot festival and sets out on a trip with his friends. Explore diverse regions of a futuristic city where robots perform crucial tasks, as the main character navigates through a host of challenges, from a stern father figure to transportation breakdowns.<br><br> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> The action takes place in the near future in a parallel universe where robotics is developed.<br></li><li> All graphics in the game are drawn by hand. </li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838480/extras/1be1687f8a0ccd56ef89b5cd7500f74d.poster.avif?t=1744470936\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838480/extras/1be1687f8a0ccd56ef89b5cd7500f74d.webm?t=1744470936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838480/extras/2c8a7823abab6f4848038e03cceb1a36.avif?t=1744470936\" /></div> <br>Embark on an exciting Point &amp; Click adventure with <strong> Travel to GolemPark </strong>, a game that follows the journey of a boy named Mick who wins tickets to a robot festival and sets out on a trip with his friends. Explore diverse regions of a futuristic city where robots perform crucial tasks, as the main character navigates through a host of challenges, from a stern father figure to transportation breakdowns.<br><br> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> The action takes place in the near future in a parallel universe where robotics is developed.<br></li><li> All graphics in the game are drawn by hand. </li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838480/extras/1be1687f8a0ccd56ef89b5cd7500f74d.poster.avif?t=1744470936\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838480/extras/1be1687f8a0ccd56ef89b5cd7500f74d.webm?t=1744470936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
